}

# ---------- PUT /api/admin/scholarships/{id} and PATCH .../status ----------
# Create a draft first (T-ADM-17) and paste its scholarshipId here.
@id = PASTE_SCHOLARSHIP_ID

### T-ADM-25 no token: 401 (student or reviewer token: 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/scholarships/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "published" }

### T-ADM-26 unknown id: 404 SCHOLARSHIP_NOT_FOUND (an id that is not a UUID: 400)
